OL,3,GNEWSARailway line closes for five days
OL,4,Aafter landslip
OL,5,
OL,6,FA railway route is closed for five days
OL,7,Ffor emergency works due to a landslip,
OL,8,FNetwork Rail has said.
OL,10,FThe line between Redhill, in Surrey,
OL,11,Fand Tonbridge, in Kent, is closed until
OL,12,F1 November so works can take place to
OL,13,Fstabilise the railway near Godstone.
OL,15,FA speed restriction had been in place
OL,16,Falong the section of railway until the
OL,17,Fworks can start.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
