OL,3,GNEWSARailway line closes for five days
OL,4,Aafter landslip
OL,5,
OL,6,FNad Campbell, project manager for
OL,7,FNetwork Rail, apologised and said: "We
OL,8,Fknow closing the line between Redhill
OL,9,Fand Tonbridge will frustrate
OL,10,Fpassengers, and we have not taken this
OL,11,Fdecision lightly."
